      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand that you are in an incredibly painful and overwhelming situation right now, and I want you to know I hear you. Please focus on taking just the next small breath, and if you can, try to find a way to call for emergency help immediately. If you can reach 911 or another emergency service, please do so right now to get immediate help and support in your physical and emotional crisis.",
